# 🎭 Persona-to-Copy Translation Guide: Audience Lens Execution

## Executive Overview & Purpose

This guide outlines a systematic process for applying **Persona Lenses** to baseline copy. While the *Baseline Copy & Voice Guide* defines *how the brand speaks*, this translation framework defines *how messaging adapts* to address the specific motivations, anxieties, and trigger moments of different customer segments—without breaking the brand's core voice or descending into caricatures.

